1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
What if you drilled straight through the Earth...

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:03,640
and jumped in?

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:04,900
First, the drill.

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,180
It rips through the crust

5
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:06,980
like nothing.

6
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,220
But the deeper you go,

7
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,480
the hotter it gets.

8
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,960
The mantle isn't lava.

9
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,020
It's solid rock,

10
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:12,640
glowing hot

11
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:14,240
under crushing pressure.

12
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,920
Your drill starts to fail.

13
00:00:15,940 --> 00:00:16,840
Below that,

14
00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,380
a sea of liquid iron

15
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,800
around a solid core

16
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:21,820
as hot as the Sun's surface.

17
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:23,460
Your drill? Gone.

18
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:25,460
But suppose the tunnel existed.

19
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,980
No air, no friction.

20
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:27,800
You jump.

21
00:00:27,820 --> 00:00:28,760
You fall faster.

22
00:00:28,780 --> 00:00:29,940
And faster.

23
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:30,840
At the center,

24
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:31,920
there's no net pull.

25
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,820
But you're at top speed.

26
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,520
You fly straight past,

27
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:36,200
slowing down

28
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:37,700
until you just reach

29
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:38,460
the other side.

30
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:39,900
Then you fall back.

31
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:40,860
Without friction,

32
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:41,740
back and forth

33
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,700
forever.

